1
00:00:35,076 --> 00:00:37,245
<i>It feel so good</i>
<i>that I'm able to witness this.</i>

2
00:00:37,328 --> 00:00:39,664
<i>Even her priorities have shifted.</i>

3
00:00:39,748 --> 00:00:42,208
What's improtant to you have become
important to her as well.

4
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:44,294
I hope I can witness
your mission accomplished.

5
00:00:44,377 --> 00:00:46,171
<i>To achieve that simple life.</i>

6
00:00:46,254 --> 00:00:47,130
Thank you.

7
00:00:50,049 --> 00:00:52,010
Angelito has been sleeping all this time.

8
00:00:52,093 --> 00:00:53,344
Will he still be able to wake up?

9
00:00:53,428 --> 00:00:54,971
I will do everything I can, Sofie.

10
00:00:56,056 --> 00:00:57,182
Just believe.

11
00:01:18,328 --> 00:01:21,915
<i>Agents, be ready. You know what to do.</i>

12
00:01:39,974 --> 00:01:41,100
Who is this?

13
00:01:41,601 --> 00:01:42,727
Where?

14
00:01:47,315 --> 00:01:48,358
Who is this?

15
00:01:48,441 --> 00:01:49,275
It's us!

16
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,318
Hold on.

17
00:02:03,331 --> 00:02:04,332
Sianong?

18
00:02:05,041 --> 00:02:05,875
Sianong.

19
00:02:08,878 --> 00:02:10,171
Duh?

20
00:02:51,421 --> 00:02:54,716
I didn't train in martial arts
and boxing just to back down from a fight.

21
00:02:55,717 --> 00:02:56,759
They're just guns.

22
00:02:57,343 --> 00:02:58,678
Aren't you scared?

23
00:03:00,096 --> 00:03:01,139
I am.

24
00:03:06,394 --> 00:03:08,938
I won't die without putting up a fight.

25
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:12,984
Sofie.

26
00:03:13,860 --> 00:03:15,111
I'll help you.

27
00:03:15,194 --> 00:03:16,237
- Angelito,
- Angelito,

28
00:03:16,321 --> 00:03:19,073
don't push yourself.
Your body isn't ready yet.

29
00:03:20,283 --> 00:03:21,409
Lady Amor.

30
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,912
Please take care of Angelito.

31
00:03:24,579 --> 00:03:26,581
I'll handle the enemies.

32
00:03:28,583 --> 00:03:29,667
Sofie!

33
00:04:00,531 --> 00:04:01,783
Daddy Sir.

34
00:04:07,497 --> 00:04:08,831
Sofie!

35
00:04:09,540 --> 00:04:10,625
Come here!

36
00:04:10,708 --> 00:04:12,085
Come here! Come with me!

37
00:04:12,794 --> 00:04:13,795
Let me go!

38
00:04:18,508 --> 00:04:19,467
Angelito!

39
00:04:20,134 --> 00:04:21,052
Sofie, my child!

40
00:04:21,135 --> 00:04:22,262
Daddy Sir!

41
00:04:24,931 --> 00:04:26,266
How are you?

42
00:04:26,349 --> 00:04:27,183
Are you hurt?

43
00:04:27,267 --> 00:04:28,977
No, I'm okay, Daddy Sir.

44
00:04:32,063 --> 00:04:33,356
You're safe now.

45
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:34,983
Let's get out of here.

46
00:04:38,027 --> 00:04:38,861
- Rafa.
- Come on.

47
00:04:38,945 --> 00:04:40,780
Help Angelito.

48
00:04:40,863 --> 00:04:41,698
Let's go.

49
00:04:42,573 --> 00:04:43,950
Come on, Sofie.

50
00:04:54,002 --> 00:04:55,295
I'm out of ammo.

51
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:57,797
I still have some.

52
00:05:03,011 --> 00:05:03,845
I'm out too.

53
00:05:03,928 --> 00:05:05,138
Agent Sianong!

54
00:05:24,741 --> 00:05:26,743
- Agent Sianong, your body can't take it.
- Let me fight.

55
00:05:26,826 --> 00:05:27,994
You need to rest.

56
00:05:31,831 --> 00:05:32,832
We'll take it from here.

57
00:05:32,915 --> 00:05:33,750
We'll take it from here.

58
00:05:53,019 --> 00:05:54,771
Get down!

59
00:06:07,867 --> 00:06:09,952
General Norberto, where's Angelito?

60
00:06:10,036 --> 00:06:11,454
Over there, in the vehicle.

61
00:06:13,247 --> 00:06:14,290
Angelito!

62
00:06:15,291 --> 00:06:16,501
Angelito!

63
00:06:22,048 --> 00:06:22,924
Alex!

64
00:06:23,466 --> 00:06:25,176
- Angelito.
- Sianong!

65
00:06:32,475 --> 00:06:33,768
- Angelito!
- Angelito!

66
00:06:33,851 --> 00:06:34,685
Angelito!

67
00:06:34,769 --> 00:06:35,937
Wake up!

68
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:36,854
Angelito!

69
00:06:36,938 --> 00:06:37,939
- Dara.
- Hurry! Hurry!

70
00:06:38,022 --> 00:06:39,440
- Wait…
- Bok! Bok!

71
00:06:39,524 --> 00:06:40,733
You can do it, Bok.

72
00:06:40,817 --> 00:06:41,692
I've got him.

73
00:06:41,776 --> 00:06:43,069
Easy, easy.

74
00:06:47,365 --> 00:06:48,491
Move! Move! Move!

75
00:06:59,001 --> 00:06:59,961
Angelito.

76
00:07:00,044 --> 00:07:01,254
Wake up!

77
00:07:01,337 --> 00:07:02,380
Help!

78
00:07:02,964 --> 00:07:04,090
Help!

79
00:07:05,049 --> 00:07:06,217
Angelito, I'm sorry.

80
00:07:06,300 --> 00:07:07,301
Help!

81
00:07:08,469 --> 00:07:09,512
- Angelito.
- Angelito.

82
00:07:10,763 --> 00:07:12,306
Help!

83
00:07:15,226 --> 00:07:16,436
Hey, help!

84
00:07:17,603 --> 00:07:18,438
Angelito.

85
00:07:27,655 --> 00:07:28,990
How's the patient, Doc?

86
00:07:40,168 --> 00:07:41,002
Thank you, Doc.

87
00:07:44,005 --> 00:07:45,006
Alex.

88
00:10:17,158 --> 00:10:19,076
Doc. How's Angelito?

89
00:10:31,589 --> 00:10:32,798
Thank you, Doc.

90
00:10:40,306 --> 00:10:41,307
But…

91
00:10:42,391 --> 00:10:44,435
we still have a bigger problem.

92
00:10:47,897 --> 00:10:49,190
La Morte Bianca.

93
00:10:55,863 --> 00:10:57,031
Mikoy.

94
00:11:02,036 --> 00:11:03,829
You don't have to come.

95
00:11:03,913 --> 00:11:05,289
Stay with your brother.

96
00:11:07,708 --> 00:11:09,585
keep me updated.

97
00:11:10,294 --> 00:11:12,630
Yes, sir. Thank you.

98
00:11:12,713 --> 00:11:15,216
Don't worry, sweetheart.
I'll be back soon.

99
00:11:18,928 --> 00:11:19,804
Let's go.

100
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:36,654
John.

101
00:11:36,737 --> 00:11:38,239
Take the knight.

102
00:11:39,323 --> 00:11:40,783
Take the knight.

103
00:11:45,037 --> 00:11:46,163
Dummy!

104
00:11:46,247 --> 00:11:48,416
I said take it with the bishop!

105
00:11:48,499 --> 00:11:50,334
I have good news.

106
00:11:52,002 --> 00:11:53,045
Everyone's safe.

107
00:11:53,129 --> 00:11:54,755
- Yes!
- Really?

108
00:11:54,839 --> 00:11:56,841
Thank God.

109
00:11:56,924 --> 00:11:59,218
Can I please see them?

110
00:11:59,301 --> 00:12:01,429
Or at least talk to them?

111
00:12:01,512 --> 00:12:03,222
Please lend me a phone.

112
00:12:03,305 --> 00:12:04,557
Just so I can talk to them.

113
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:05,850
Yes!

114
00:12:05,933 --> 00:12:07,852
I'm sorry, Ma'am Tess.

115
00:12:07,935 --> 00:12:11,355
I can request it from the agency, but…

116
00:12:11,439 --> 00:12:13,399
I can't promise they'll approve it.

117
00:12:14,442 --> 00:12:15,484
That's unfair.

118
00:12:15,568 --> 00:12:18,612
But, Officer,

119
00:12:18,696 --> 00:12:20,573
I hope you understand.

120
00:12:20,656 --> 00:12:23,409
Don't you have parents too? A mother?

121
00:12:23,492 --> 00:12:25,744
Who's the first person
you call when you're sick?

122
00:12:25,828 --> 00:12:28,247
- Isn't it your mother?
- He's right, bro.

123
00:12:30,666 --> 00:12:31,709
Just imagine

124
00:12:31,792 --> 00:12:34,044
Tess was your mother.

125
00:12:34,128 --> 00:12:34,962
Just imagine.

126
00:12:45,181 --> 00:12:46,515
Children matter to their mothers.

127
00:12:46,599 --> 00:12:49,185
So let Ma'am Tess talk to Mikoy.

128
00:12:49,268 --> 00:12:51,103
He's right, boss.

129
00:12:51,187 --> 00:12:53,772
If Ma'am Tess gets sick, it'll be on you.

130
00:12:53,856 --> 00:12:55,441
I'll be held accountable

131
00:12:55,524 --> 00:12:57,151
if I violate protocol.

132
00:12:57,234 --> 00:12:59,361
The rules are clear. No phones.

133
00:12:59,445 --> 00:13:01,989
You already snuck in a cellphone.

134
00:13:02,072 --> 00:13:04,116
I didn't even report you.

135
00:13:05,326 --> 00:13:06,494
It's the same thing.

136
00:13:06,577 --> 00:13:08,579
You'll be accountable if you allow Tess.

137
00:13:08,662 --> 00:13:10,539
You'll be accountable
if you break protocol.

138
00:13:10,623 --> 00:13:12,458
So do the right thing.

139
00:13:12,541 --> 00:13:14,043
He's right, son.

140
00:13:15,044 --> 00:13:16,128
Please!

141
00:13:18,589 --> 00:13:19,673
Fine.

142
00:13:19,757 --> 00:13:22,510
But if I get in trouble for this,

143
00:13:22,593 --> 00:13:24,053
you're all coming down with me.

144
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:28,224
All clear.

145
00:13:31,644 --> 00:13:33,562
Thank you so much, son.

146
00:13:37,274 --> 00:13:39,276
Hey, that knight's still hanging.

147
00:13:42,530 --> 00:13:45,157
Boss, you seem a little hot.

148
00:13:49,828 --> 00:13:52,414
Do you know what they call it
when Ben gets sick?

149
00:13:52,498 --> 00:13:53,499
- What?
- What?

150
00:13:53,999 --> 00:13:55,125
Sick-si-Ben.

151
00:13:55,709 --> 00:13:56,752
Sick-si-Ben.

152
00:13:56,835 --> 00:13:58,337
Sick-si-Ben.

153
00:13:58,420 --> 00:13:59,922
Sick-si-Ben.

154
00:14:00,005 --> 00:14:01,090
Sick-si-Ben.

155
00:14:13,811 --> 00:14:15,145
Mikoy, my son.

156
00:14:16,230 --> 00:14:17,856
My dear Mikoy.

157
00:14:23,487 --> 00:14:25,281
Mikoy, my son!

158
00:14:25,364 --> 00:14:26,907
Mikoy, how are you?

159
00:14:26,991 --> 00:14:29,159
<i>Are you hurt? Let me see.</i>

160
00:14:29,994 --> 00:14:31,620
Mom, how did you get a phone?

161
00:14:31,704 --> 00:14:34,248
Never mind that. How are you?

162
00:14:34,331 --> 00:14:36,083
I'm perfectly fine.

163
00:14:36,959 --> 00:14:39,169
You know I'm an action star now.

164
00:14:39,837 --> 00:14:41,630
<i>And I take after Dad.</i>

165
00:14:41,714 --> 00:14:44,383
Those enemies are no match for me, Mom.

166
00:14:45,342 --> 00:14:46,468
That's right.

167
00:14:46,552 --> 00:14:50,347
Besides, I'm the son
of the Butuan Executioner.

168
00:14:50,431 --> 00:14:51,473
<i>Oh, stop that.</i>

169
00:14:51,557 --> 00:14:54,226
<i>I don't like hearing about executioners.</i>

170
00:14:54,310 --> 00:14:58,898
<i>Didn't your father leave the service</i>
<i>so we could have a peaceful life?</i>

171
00:14:58,981 --> 00:15:02,568
<i>I just want my cheerful Mikoy.</i>
<i>That's all I want, son.</i>

172
00:15:04,403 --> 00:15:05,863
Mom.

173
00:15:05,946 --> 00:15:07,907
I'm still your cheerful Mikoy.

174
00:15:07,990 --> 00:15:10,868
I've just learned how to fight now.

175
00:15:11,785 --> 00:15:13,954
I'm still cheerful, just more fearless.

176
00:15:14,038 --> 00:15:14,955
That's it.

177
00:15:15,039 --> 00:15:17,625
I'm glad you haven't changed, son.

178
00:15:17,708 --> 00:15:21,712
Of course, Mom.
You raised Angelito and I well.

179
00:15:23,631 --> 00:15:25,674
<i>How's Angelito? What did the doctor say?</i>

180
00:15:27,801 --> 00:15:29,011
<i>Angelito…</i>

181
00:15:29,094 --> 00:15:30,346
Mom, Mom, relax.

182
00:15:30,429 --> 00:15:32,056
Angelito's okay.

183
00:15:32,139 --> 00:15:33,057
<i>Okay?</i>

184
00:15:33,557 --> 00:15:35,100
<i>They said he's stable.</i>

185
00:15:35,184 --> 00:15:36,685
The doctor said

186
00:15:36,769 --> 00:15:39,355
his radiation exposure wasn't that severe.

187
00:15:39,939 --> 00:15:41,815
He just needs plenty of rest.

188
00:15:42,524 --> 00:15:44,151
Thank God.

189
00:15:44,234 --> 00:15:45,069
You know, son,

190
00:15:45,152 --> 00:15:48,989
I think I prayed to every saint
just to keep you safe.

191
00:15:49,782 --> 00:15:51,450
When will this all end?

192
00:15:52,117 --> 00:15:54,036
I just want all of this to be over.

193
00:15:54,954 --> 00:15:55,913
But Mom,

194
00:15:56,497 --> 00:16:00,709
this will only end
once we defeat La Morte Bianca.

195
00:16:02,127 --> 00:16:03,504
And it won't be easy.

196
00:16:06,465 --> 00:16:07,967
Storms don't last forever.

197
00:16:09,051 --> 00:16:11,220
This storm will pass too.

198
00:16:12,596 --> 00:16:14,098
Just have faith, Mom.

199
00:16:15,724 --> 00:16:16,809
I love you, Mom.

200
00:16:18,060 --> 00:16:19,311
Bye-bye, son.

201
00:16:20,104 --> 00:16:21,480
Take care, son.

202
00:16:46,714 --> 00:16:48,257
there's been no word from Los Bandidos

203
00:16:48,340 --> 00:16:51,635
since they launched their surprise attack
on La Morte Bianca's fortress.

204
00:16:53,053 --> 00:16:54,054
they're already dead.

205
00:16:54,596 --> 00:16:56,056
That's what I was thinking too.

206
00:17:02,563 --> 00:17:03,939
We'll only lose more men.

207
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:15,200
By then, we could all be dead.

208
00:17:25,002 --> 00:17:27,379
Before we can even get the bomb,

209
00:17:28,047 --> 00:17:29,381
we might all be dead.

210
00:17:35,679 --> 00:17:37,431
We're not in checkmate yet.

211
00:17:38,515 --> 00:17:39,683
The Wacka-Wacka Initiative

212
00:17:42,519 --> 00:17:44,772
The bomb is her trump card.

213
00:17:47,441 --> 00:17:48,734
What do you mean?

214
00:17:55,115 --> 00:17:56,867
She'll make her move.

215
00:18:02,206 --> 00:18:05,417
She'll exploit people's weaknesses.

216
00:18:49,336 --> 00:18:52,840
And she'll use the bomb
as her insurance policy.

217
00:18:52,923 --> 00:18:55,467
So she can do whatever she wants.

218
00:18:56,051 --> 00:18:57,386
And once that happens,

219
00:18:57,469 --> 00:19:00,013
once it turns into war,
or chaos like a pandemic,

220
00:19:01,056 --> 00:19:03,600
who will people turn to for protection?

221
00:19:05,102 --> 00:19:06,937
La Morte Bianca?

222
00:19:53,442 --> 00:19:54,776
What happened?

223
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:55,819
Why are they shooting each other?

224
00:19:55,903 --> 00:19:57,362
Where did they get those guns?

225
00:19:57,446 --> 00:19:59,448
Looks like La Morte Bianca
has made her move.

226
00:20:06,496 --> 00:20:09,041
I know someone who can help us.

227
00:20:13,128 --> 00:20:14,504
Another assassin.

228
00:20:18,383 --> 00:20:19,468
Who?

229
00:20:28,644 --> 00:20:29,645
Stop distracting me.

230
00:20:29,728 --> 00:20:31,730
Don't you know I'm good at lip-reading?

231
00:20:32,564 --> 00:20:34,524
Don't be so negative. I'm concentrating.

232
00:20:35,525 --> 00:20:36,777
What did she say?

233
00:20:39,029 --> 00:20:40,697
She said he'll be coming in soon.

234
00:20:40,781 --> 00:20:42,908
Then she'll torture us.

235
00:20:44,618 --> 00:20:45,535
Oh.

236
00:20:59,716 --> 00:21:01,051
I told you so.

237
00:21:26,368 --> 00:21:27,244
Ouch!

238
00:22:49,826 --> 00:22:51,411
Do whatever you want.

239
00:23:04,049 --> 00:23:06,676
<i>I'm here outside the facility.</i>

240
00:23:12,349 --> 00:23:15,560
Agent Alex, for Chiara Valtrovi.

241
00:23:16,144 --> 00:23:17,270
For me?

242
00:23:29,866 --> 00:23:32,327
How did she know where to send the box?

243
00:23:32,410 --> 00:23:34,663
I thought it's top secret information

244
00:23:34,746 --> 00:23:36,289
and only the agents can know.

245
00:23:39,042 --> 00:23:41,378
Someone is leaking information
to the enemy.
